sequenceDiagram
    participant MQTT as MQTT owner client
    participant Runtime as Device runtime
    participant WS as WebSocket device client
    Note over MQTT,Runtime: Supported SDK establishes MQTT owner session
    WS->>Runtime: WSS GET /ws/device?devid=device-1 (Bearer upgrade)
    alt Authorized WebSocket session
        Runtime-->>WS: WebSocket upgrade accepted
        Note over Runtime: WebSocket replaces MQTT ownership
        MQTT->>Runtime: MQTT owner reconnect attempt
        Runtime-->>MQTT: Lower-priority ownership not granted
        Runtime->>WS: Supported outbound command to current owner only
    else Authentication denied
        Runtime-->>WS: Upgrade rejected
    end
    Note over Runtime: No owner means explicit command failure, not fallback
